1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,662
In 2004,

2
00:00:00,662 --> 00:00:02,285
the world came to Athens

3
00:00:02,285 --> 00:00:03,488
for the Olympics.

4
00:00:03,488 --> 00:00:05,052
So what happened to the

5
00:00:05,052 --> 00:00:05,653
venues?

6
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,549
Greece built a whole sports

7
00:00:07,549 --> 00:00:09,347
complex on its old airport,

8
