11
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,212
The Games lasted seventeen days.

12
00:00:17,212 --> 00:00:18,822
Estimates put the bill at

13
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:20,546
up to eleven billion euros.

14
00:00:20,546 --> 00:00:21,638
Ten years later,

15
00:00:21,638 --> 00:00:23,305
the softball stadium was a

16
