17
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,835
the hockey pitch untouched,

18
00:00:25,835 --> 00:00:27,789
and the canoe course abandoned.

19
00:00:27,789 --> 00:00:29,111
A worker once told a

20
00:00:29,111 --> 00:00:30,951
