21
00:00:30,951 --> 00:00:32,618
it's just that nobody ever

22
00:00:32,618 --> 00:00:33,653
plays softball.

23
00:00:33,653 --> 00:00:34,285
By then,

24
00:00:34,285 --> 00:00:35,607
Greece was deep in a

25
