29
00:00:44,709 --> 00:00:46,154
in a deal worth nine

30
00:00:46,154 --> 00:00:48,479
hundred and fifteen million euros.

31
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,492
Today, the old airport is

32
00:00:51,492 --> 00:00:53,250
becoming a new district called

33
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,156
the Ellinikon.

34
00:00:54,156 --> 00:00:55,914
The Games took seventeen days.

35
00:00:55,914 --> 00:00:57,832
Reusing this site took twenty-two

36
00:00:57,832 --> 00:00:58,312
years.

